# What EAS Build uploads. When this file exists it REPLACES .gitignore for that
# decision, which is the whole point of having it.
#
# assets/exercise-media/ used to be deliberately absent from this list, so the
# 1,305 bundled GIF demonstrations reached the builder. The demonstrations were
# removed in 4339b51 (© Gym visual, not redistributable) and nothing in app/ or src/
# loads the folder any more, so uploading its 124 MB to every build was waste — and
# sending unlicensed artwork somewhere for nothing. It is ignored here now too.
#
# Keep this in step with .gitignore.

node_modules/
.expo/
dist/
/android/
/ios/
*.log
.env*
*.db
*.db-journal
backups/
assets/exercise-media/
.DS_Store
